{"id":"33fd53bf2e8021cb","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing11 Deciding Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition — ZFC Forcing11 Deciding Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition — ZFC Forcing11 Deciding Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition — ZFC Forcing11 Deciding Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\tau\">\\(\\vec\\tau\\)</span> is a finite tuple of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> is the forcing relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DecidingCondition}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DecidingCondition}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}deciding\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DecidingCondition}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\neg\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}deciding\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DecidingCondition}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\neg\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deciding is relative to the same ground model, name tuple, forcing poset, and order as the forcing relation; suppressing those arguments made the former predicate ambiguous.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6$ is the forcing relation from [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DecidingCondition}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}deciding\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DecidingCondition}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\neg\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2026","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition.md|58-df-zfc-forcing11-deciding-condition]]（batch1